<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">arena</ansi>

The Arena is a brutal proving ground where death means
expulsion. There is no coming back.

<ansi fg="yellow">Layout:</ansi>

  A linear gauntlet of increasingly dangerous rooms.
  Push through pit fighters, veterans, and finally the
  Arena Champion. Enemies respawn — the waves never
  truly stop. How far can you get before they grind
  you down?

<ansi fg="yellow">Rules:</ansi>

  <ansi fg="red">Death ends your run.</ansi> You are expelled permanently.
  Recall magic does not work. The only way out is the
  return portal at the entrance.

  The rift stays open for 30 minutes.

<ansi fg="yellow">Loot:</ansi>

  Veterans and the Champion carry unique weapons and
  armor with random properties. More gold invested
  means tougher enemies but better gear. Each piece
  is one of a kind.

<ansi fg="yellow">How to Enter:</ansi>

  Visit the Rift Chamber (down from Temple District).
  <ansi fg="command">ask sable arena 200</ansi> — invest any amount over 100
  gold. Sable will tell you the exit command.

<ansi fg="yellow">Tips:</ansi>

  Stock your bandolier with potions and grenades.
  Party up before purchasing. Companions help.

